<%#
  A small status pill: the plain grey .pill, or tinted by `tone`. The routes pick the tone for a status
  (invites, share links, user accounts), so the tone-to-class map lives here once and Tailwind's view scan still
  sees the class names.
  Included by partials/rows/invite.ejs, partials/rows/user.ejs, partials/rows/admin-share.ejs, pages/admin/share.ejs,
  partials/admin/user-profile.ejs and partials/rows/activity.ejs (tone by event kind, routes/view/activity-page.js).
  Locals: pill, one object so nothing is inherited from the page:
    text: pill text
    tone: 'green' | 'amber' | 'red' | 'sky', or 'neutral' for the plain grey pill
-%>
<% const PILL_TONES = { green: 'pill-green', amber: 'pill-amber', red: 'pill-red', sky: 'pill-sky', neutral: '' }; -%>
<span class="pill<%= PILL_TONES[pill.tone] ? ' ' + PILL_TONES[pill.tone] : '' %>"><%= pill.text %></span>
